TechMart Global Refund Policy:
- 30-day money back guarantee for hardware devices (ApexBook Pro 15, SoundBuds Ultra, SmartWatch Elite, SmartHub Max).
- Items must be returned in original condition or packaging.
- Pro subscriptions ($14.99/mo) can be canceled anytime with pro-rated refunds for unused days within 14 days.
- Refunds processed within 3-5 business days back to original card.
